// Module a-incidental: incidental findings and discordant results. Why incidental findings on
// brain MRI and blood tests are common, the harms of chasing them, and a sensible approach;
// then what to do when the clinical picture and a test result disagree, tied to pretest
// probability, timing, technique, and interpretation.

