            compare: "Repeating the same test versus using a better test: repeating a low titer serum assay mostly reproduces the same uncertainty, while testing CSF or using a confirmatory method answers a different and better question. Repeating CSF after the first week in Guillain-Barre syndrome is useful because timing, not method, was the problem.",
